title: "circular-gh-ifc-ai: Grasshopper workflow for LLM-assisted IFC data enrichment"
abstract: >-
  Proof-of-concept Grasshopper definition and example BIM/IFC models supporting
  LLM-assisted semantic enrichment of IFC data and element-level circularity
  scoring for Polish large-panel (LPS) building systems.
